<title>ESTONIA: MOODY'S TO MEET ON COUNTRY RATING.</title>
<headline>MOODY'S TO MEET ON COUNTRY RATING.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rating agency Moody's will on July 15 meet several Estonian state organisations to prepare for the country's first credit rating, the ministry of economics said on Monday.</p>
<p>The rating agency will meet the ministry of economics, Estonia's central bank, the ministry of finance and Estonia's investment agency, a spokesperson for the ministry told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
